BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (identical event returns the same lead, while reusing its key with different evidence raises an error. Module three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (serializes verification and acceptance under BEGIN IMMEDIATE, checks the expected version, and inserts the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (opportunity invoice inside that same transaction. Concurrent writers therefore cannot accept the same version twice or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (create duplicate charges through this workflow. A stale reviewer must reload the record rather than overwrite another) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (reviewer's decision. Install the schema and views before starting workers, and give each worker its own connection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (with the same connection settings. Keep the database on a supported local filesystem, not a shared network mount.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Lock contention may delay or reject work; it must never cause a caller to invent a new event identifier.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (The verification hold is a contractual billing hold, not custody of client funds. Pending records can become verified or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (rejected; verified records can become accepted or rejected. Accepted records are terminal in this reference, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (acceptance creates exactly one $3,750 fee. There is no escrow account, borrower settlement balance, or merchant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (principal inside operator revenue. Evidence references point to access-controlled review artifacts; the program validates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (their presence but does not authenticate the reviewer or prove the underlying business claim. Production deployment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (must add that authorization layer before exposing mutation functions. The cash module records already observed bank) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (postings and refuses allocations exceeding an invoice's remaining balance. A compound bank-account and transaction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (identifier prevents the same posting from being applied elsewhere. The demonstration assumes one invoice per bank) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (posting; split remittances require a parent receipt and allocation subledger with a transactionally enforced aggregate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (ceiling. Likewise, credits, refunds, taxes, foreign exchange, and contested acceptances require additional immutable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (event types rather than manual SQL edits. Do not mistake a small, auditable core for a complete accounting platform.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (Restrict direct database writes to controlled migration and recovery procedures with preserved audit evidence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (The reconciliation views separate service-period revenue from bank-period receipts and show outstanding balances) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (independently. Expenses in the demonstration are both incurred and paid during their assigned month, making the cash) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (bridge explicit. Module six creates the exact cohort used in the next section and asserts every financial total. It also) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (replays a bank event to prove that an ordinary retry changes nothing. Extend testing with two independent connections,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (forced worker termination between statements, stale version submissions, conflicting payloads, and concurrent receipt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (allocations. A transaction either commits its complete local mutation or rolls back; no network side effect occurs inside) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (these modules. That boundary matters: emailing an invoice or charging a card cannot become exactly-once merely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (because a database row is unique. For external actions, write an outbox item in the originating transaction and use the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (same immutable identifier with a provider-supported idempotency mechanism. When the provider lacks that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (mechanism, reconcile ambiguous outcomes before retrying. Back up through SQLite's supported backup interface, test) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm (restoration, and verify foreign keys after recovery. The code is a reference artifact supplied here, not an execution or) Tj ET
